{"comment_text": {"ja20:0.1": "", "ja20:0.2": "", "ja20:0.3": "", "ja20:0.4": "", "ja20:1.1": "A monster dwells in the lake, but the Bodhisatta thwarts him and keeps his people safe by drinking through long hollow reeds. ", "ja20:1.2": "", "ja20:1.3": "", "ja20:1.4": "", "ja20:2.1": "", "ja20:2.2": "", "ja20:3.1": "", "ja20:4.1": "", "ja20:4.2": "", "ja20:4.3": "", "ja20:4.4": ""}, "html_text": {"ja20:0.1": "<article id='ja20'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja20:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja20:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja20:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja20:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja20:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja20:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja20:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja20:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja20:2.2": "<p class='endvagga'>{}</p>", "ja20:3.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja20:4.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja20:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja20:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja20:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja20:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja20:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja20:0.3": "Sīlavagga ", "ja20:0.4": "10. Naḷapānajātaka ", "ja20:1.1": "“Disvā padamanuttiṇṇaṁ, ", "ja20:1.2": "Disvānotaritaṁ padaṁ; ", "ja20:1.3": "Naḷena vāriṁ pissāma, ", "ja20:1.4": "Neva maṁ tvaṁ vadhissasī”ti. ", "ja20:2.1": "Naḷapānajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja20:2.2": "Sīlavaggo dutiyo. ", "ja20:3.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja20:4.1": "Atha lakkhaṇa sākha dhiratthu puna, ", "ja20:4.2": "Na kiratthi rasehi kharādiyā; ", "ja20:4.3": "Atibhoti vara māluta pāṇa, ", "ja20:4.4": "Muccena naḷaavhayanena bhavanti dasāti. "}, "translation_text": {"ja20:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 20 ", "ja20:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja20:0.3": "Ethics ", "ja20:0.4": "The Reed Drink: a past life story ", "ja20:1.1": "Seeing footprints go down into the water, ", "ja20:1.2": "and none that return, ", "ja20:1.3": "we shall drink water through a reed: ", "ja20:1.4": "no way shall you kill me. ", "ja20:2.1": "", "ja20:2.2": "", "ja20:3.1": "", "ja20:4.1": "", "ja20:4.2": "", "ja20:4.3": "", "ja20:4.4": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja20:0.1": "", "ja20:0.2": "", "ja20:0.3": "", "ja20:0.4": "", "ja20:1.1": "", "ja20:1.2": "", "ja20:1.3": "pissāma → pivissāma (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja20:1.4": "Neva → na ca (mr) ", "ja20:2.1": "", "ja20:2.2": "", "ja20:3.1": "", "ja20:4.1": "", "ja20:4.2": "", "ja20:4.3": "vara → rasa (sabbattha) ", "ja20:4.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja20:0.1": "", "ja20:0.2": "", "ja20:0.3": "", "ja20:0.4": "", "ja20:1.1": "ms22J_42, msdiv20, pts-vp-pli1.171", "ja20:1.2": "", "ja20:1.3": "", "ja20:1.4": "", "ja20:2.1": "ms22J_43", "ja20:2.2": "", "ja20:3.1": "ms22J_44", "ja20:4.1": "csp1ed22.6, csp2ed22.6, dr27.8, ms22J_45", "ja20:4.2": "", "ja20:4.3": "", "ja20:4.4": ""}, "keys_order": ["ja20:0.1", "ja20:0.2", "ja20:0.3", "ja20:0.4", "ja20:1.1", "ja20:1.2", "ja20:1.3", "ja20:1.4", "ja20:2.1", "ja20:2.2", "ja20:3.1", "ja20:4.1", "ja20:4.2", "ja20:4.3", "ja20:4.4"]}